{"baseRefName":"master","baseRefOid":"743a3ba0706fde95e2095ad42ffefe219d807117","body":"This is the trailers variant of the fix for reading the body in #3275, so that it is possible to both attempt to read the body and the trailers when the server has sent a `RST_STREAM` with `NO_ERROR` after its response to indicate that the client should stop attempting to send it the body.\r\n\r\nI have added a trailers-only variant of `http2_responds_before_consuming_request_body` that fails without the fix, and also updated `http2_responds_before_consuming_request_body` to verify that it can check whether there are any trailers.","comments":[],"files":[{"path":"src/body/incoming.rs","additions":18,"deletions":9,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"tests/client.rs","additions":89,"deletions":8,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefName":"early-response-trailers-1.x","headRefOid":"4d4e0dfc099d7177721a8dce70fedbea1e6c98e6","labels":[],"mergedAt":"2026-04-22T21:40:56Z","number":3998,"reviewDecision":"APPROVED","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDOAWaYQc7XEvu-","author":{"login":"seanmonstar"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"","submittedAt":"2025-12-23T14:54:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"f25a96a8c2ef23ce66b32b0cd06838c4bf88a2ac"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDOAWaYQc7YNx8T","author":{"login":"ulyssa"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-01-05T16:12:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"f25a96a8c2ef23ce66b32b0cd06838c4bf88a2ac"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDOAWaYQc7YOA42","author":{"login":"ulyssa"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-01-05T16:27:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"f25a96a8c2ef23ce66b32b0cd06838c4bf88a2ac"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDOAWaYQc7313BQ","author":{"login":"seanmonstar"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"Thanks so much for the fix!","submittedAt":"2026-04-22T21:39:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"state":"APPROVED","commit":{"oid":"4d4e0dfc099d7177721a8dce70fedbea1e6c98e6"}}],"state":"MERGED","title":"fix(client): reading trailers shouldn't propagate `NO_ERROR` from early response","url":"https://github.com/hyperium/hyper/pull/3998"}
